{
  "id": "self_organizing_agent_teams",
  "title": "Self-Organizing Agent Teams",
  "category": "benchmark_news",
  "domain_taxonomy": "algorithmic_search",
  "hook_tag": "AGENT COLLABORATION EVOLUTION",
  "beats": [
    {
      "beat_id": 1,
      "text": "Why do lone AI agents fail at hard tasks, even when they know the math? Let us see how teams fix this.",
      "visual_focus": "A lone, flickering light bulb representing an agent struggling with a complex geometric puzzle.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "lone AI agents": "#EF4444",
        "teams": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Single Agent",
        "action_verb": "stumbles",
        "direct_object": "Complex Logic Gate",
        "anchor_word": "fail",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 2,
      "text": "Think of it like a group of people solving a jigsaw puzzle. Without a plan, they just get in each other's way.",
      "visual_focus": "Animated puzzle pieces floating in space, overlapping and bumping into one another chaotically.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "jigsaw puzzle": "#F59E0B",
        "in each other's way": "#EF4444"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Puzzle Pieces",
        "action_verb": "clash",
        "direct_object": "Collaborative Workspace",
        "anchor_word": "way",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 3,
      "text": "New teams do not use fixed rules. They learn how to chat, swap info, and fix mistakes as they work together.",
      "visual_focus": "Nodes connecting with lines that thicken and brighten as they communicate and refine a shared idea.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "learn": "#34D399",
        "swap info": "#38BDF8"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Agent Nodes",
        "action_verb": "link",
        "direct_object": "Shared Strategy Map",
        "anchor_word": "learn",
        "semantic_role": "state_transition"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "They act like a sculptor carving marble. Each agent chips away bad logic until the clear, true answer appears bright.",
      "visual_focus": "A glowing crystal being chiseled by multiple small tools, revealing a perfectly structured geometric shape inside.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "sculptor": "#F59E0B",
        "clear, true answer": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Agent Team",
        "action_verb": "refines",
        "direct_object": "Partial Reasoning",
        "anchor_word": "chips",
        "semantic_role": "causal_elimination"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 5,
      "text": "The result is huge. These teams hit sixty-six percent accuracy, far beating any single member working on their own alone.",
      "visual_focus": "A bar chart where the 'Team' bar rapidly grows to tower over the individual agent columns.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "sixty-six percent": "#34D399",
        "far beating": "#38BDF8"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Performance Metric",
        "action_verb": "surpasses",
        "direct_object": "Independent Baseline",
        "anchor_word": "beating",
        "semantic_role": "metric_evaluation"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 6,
      "text": "Follow The Model Verse for simple explanations of how modern AI actually works.",
      "visual_focus": "The Model Verse logo appears in the center, pulsing with a clean, soft mint light.",
      "highlight_words": {
        "The Model Verse": "#34D399"
      },
      "svo_action": {
        "subject": "Brand Logo",
        "action_verb": "appears",
        "direct_object": "Center Stage",
        "anchor_word": "Model Verse",
        "semantic_role": "agent_action"
      }
    }
  ],
